From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruiyangke <me@ry.ke>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] notification: Always show the close button on touch screens

A notification's close button appears on hover. A touch screen has no hover,
so on iPadOS and Android a notification could not be dismissed by hand.

On those platforms the button is always shown.

Send upstream.
---
 crates/component/src/notification.rs | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/component/src/notification.rs b/crates/component/src/notification.rs
index 76e08249..a3ba123d 100644
--- a/crates/component/src/notification.rs
+++ b/crates/component/src/notification.rs
@@ -457,8 +457,10 @@ impl Render for Notification {
                     .absolute()
                     .top_1()
                     .right_1()
-                    .invisible()
-                    .group_hover("", |this| this.visible())
+                    // A touch screen has no hover to reveal it: always shown.
+                    .when(!cfg!(any(target_os = "ios", target_os = "android")), |this| {
+                        this.invisible().group_hover("", |this| this.visible())
+                    })
                     .child(
                         Button::new("close")
                             .icon(IconName::Close)
